=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.atom.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exchange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  clear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.atom.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"完整的原子操作执行路径\">完整的原子操作执行路径</h3><p>从应用代码到硬件执行的完整链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant APP as Application Code&#10;    participant LIB as Atomic Variable Wrapper&#10;    participant CPU as CPU Core&#10;    participant CACHE as L1 Cache&#10;    participant BUS as Memory Bus&#10;    participant OTHER as Other Core Caches&#10;&#10;    APP-&gt;&gt;LIB: atomicCounter.fetchAdd(1)&#10;    LIB-&gt;&gt;CPU: Issue LOCK XADD instruction&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)&#10;        Note over CPU,BUS: Atomic execution region&#10;        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Lock target cache line&#10;        CACHE-&gt;&gt;BUS: Send invalidation signal&#10;        BUS-&gt;&gt;OTHER: Invalidate copies in other cores&#10;        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Read current value&#10;        CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: Compute new value&#10;        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Write new value&#10;        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Release cache line lock&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    LIB-&gt;&gt;APP: Return old value\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant APP as Application Code\n    participant LIB as Atomic Variable Wrapper\n    participant CPU as CPU Core\n    participant CACHE as L1 Cache\n    participant BUS as Memory Bus\n    participant OTHER as Other Core Caches\n\n    APP-&gt;&gt;LIB: atomicCounter.fetchAdd(1)\n    LIB-&gt;&gt;CPU: Issue LOCK XADD instruction\n\n    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)\n        Note over CPU,BUS: Atomic execution region\n        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Lock target cache line\n        CACHE-&gt;&gt;BUS: Send invalidation signal\n        BUS-&gt;&gt;OTHER: Invalidate copies in other cores\n        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Read current value\n        CPU-&gt;&gt;CPU: Compute new value\n        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Write new value\n        CPU-&gt;&gt;CACHE: Release cache line lock\n    end\n\n    LIB-&gt;&gt;APP: Return old value</pre><h3 id=\"多线程竞争下的执行时序\">多线程竞争下的执行时序</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant MEM as Shared Memory&#10;    participant A as Core 0 (Thread A)&#10;    participant B as Core 1 (Thread B)&#10;&#10;    Note over MEM: flags = 0&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;MEM: CAS(0, 1) Lock cache line&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;MEM: CAS(0, 1) Wait for cache line release&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;A: CAS succeeded&#10;        Note over A: Acquired operation rights&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;B: CAS failed (value already changed to 1)&#10;        Note over B: Re-read, spin retry&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;MEM: load() → 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Waiting for condition to be met...\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant MEM as Shared Memory\n    participant A as Core 0 (Thread A)\n    participant B as Core 1 (Thread B)\n\n    Note over MEM: flags = 0\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;MEM: CAS(0, 1) Lock cache line\n    B-&gt;&gt;MEM: CAS(0, 1) Wait for cache line release\n\n    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)\n        A-&gt;&gt;A: CAS succeeded\n        Note over A: Acquired operation rights\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)\n        B-&gt;&gt;B: CAS failed (value already changed to 1)\n        Note over B: Re-read, spin retry\n    end\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;MEM: load() → 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Waiting for condition to be met...</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优劣对比\">优劣对比</h2><h3 id=\"原子操作的适用边界\">原子操作的适用边界</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">场景</th>\n<th align=\"left\">推荐方案</th>\n<th align=\"left\">原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">单变量计数器</td>\n<td align=\"left\">原子操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">简单高效，无锁开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">布尔标志位</td>\n<td align=\"left\">原子操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">AtomicFlag 即可满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">两个变量的一致性更新</td>\n<td align=\"left\">锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">原子操作无法保证跨变量一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">复杂数据结构修改</td>\n<td align=\"left\">锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要保护多步操作的整体性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">高竞争热点变量</td>\n<td align=\"left\">评估后决定</td>\n<td align=\"left\">自旋开销可能超过锁开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">无锁队列/栈</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CAS + 精心设计</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可行但复杂度高，需处理 ABA 问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"各种同步机制对比\">各种同步机制对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">原子读写</th>\n<th align=\"left\">CAS</th>\n<th align=\"left\">自旋锁</th>\n<th align=\"left\">互斥锁</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>实现层次</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 指令</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 指令</td>\n<td align=\"left\">原子指令 + 循环</td>\n<td align=\"left\">操作系统内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>阻塞方式</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">忙等待（占 CPU）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">挂起等待（让出 CPU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>开销</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">极小</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小</td>\n<td align=\"left\">中等</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>公平性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不适用</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不保证</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不保证</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>适用场景</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">简单标志</td>\n<td align=\"left\">单值更新</td>\n<td align=\"left\">短临界区</td>\n<td align=\"left\">长临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>死锁风险</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n<td align=\"left\">极低</td>\n<td align=\"left\">有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>活锁风险</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n<td align=\"left\">有（高竞争）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">有（高竞争）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"局限性\">局限性</h3><p>原子操作虽然高效，但存在明确的<strong>适用边界</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;Need thread safety?&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| PLAIN[&quot;Regular variable is sufficient&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| Q2{&quot;Operation complexity?&quot;}&#10;&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;Single variable&lt;br/&gt;Single operation&quot;| ATOMIC[&quot;Atomic operations ✅&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;Multiple variables&lt;br/&gt;Multi-step operation&quot;| LOCK[&quot;Use locks&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ATOMIC --&gt; Q3{&quot;Contention level?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Low&quot;| BEST[&quot;Best choice 🏆&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;High&quot;| MEASURE[&quot;Performance testing needed&lt;br/&gt;May degrade&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"Need thread safety?\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"No\"| PLAIN[\"Regular variable is sufficient\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"Yes\"| Q2{\"Operation complexity?\"}\n\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"Single variable&lt;br/&gt;Single operation\"| ATOMIC[\"Atomic operations ✅\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"Multiple variables&lt;br/&gt;Multi-step operation\"| LOCK[\"Use locks\"]\n\n    ATOMIC --&gt; Q3{\"Contention level?\"}\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Low\"| BEST[\"Best choice 🏆\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"High\"| MEASURE[\"Performance testing needed&lt;br/&gt;May degrade\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// ❌ 原子操作无法做到的事情&#10;&#10;// 1. 无法原子地操作两个变量&#10;原子变量 x = 10&#10;原子变量 y = 20&#10;// 没有办法原子地同时修改 x 和 y&#10;&#10;// 2. 无法原子地执行条件逻辑&#10;// &quot;如果 x &gt; 0 则 y = y + x&quot; 无法用单个原子操作表达&#10;&#10;// 3. 无法原子地操作复杂数据结构&#10;// 向链表中插入节点涉及修改多个指针，单个原子操作无法完成&#10;// （虽然可以用 CAS 构建无锁链表，但这需要精心设计，不是简单的原子操作）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 原子操作无法做到的事情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 无法原子地操作两个变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>原子变量 x = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>原子变量 y = 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 没有办法原子地同时修改 x 和 y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 无法原子地执行条件逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// \"如果 x > 0 则 y = y + x\" 无法用单个原子操作表达</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 无法原子地操作复杂数据结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 向链表中插入节点涉及修改多个指针，单个原子操作无法完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// （虽然可以用 CAS 构建无锁链表，但这需要精心设计，不是简单的原子操作）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    IMPL[&quot;Atomic Operation Implementation&quot;]&#10;&#10;    HW[&quot;Hardware Support&quot;]&#10;    HW1[&quot;CAS Instruction&quot;]&#10;    HW2[&quot;XCHG Instruction&quot;]&#10;    HW3[&quot;XADD Instruction&quot;]&#10;    HW4[&quot;LOCK Prefix&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PROTO[&quot;Cache Coherence&quot;]&#10;    P1[&quot;MESI Protocol&quot;]&#10;    P2[&quot;Cache Line Locking&quot;]&#10;&#10;    SW[&quot;Software Wrapper&quot;]&#10;    S1[&quot;Atomic Variable Class&quot;]&#10;    S2[&quot;load / store&quot;]&#10;    S3[&quot;fetchAdd / CAS&quot;]&#10;&#10;    LIMIT[&quot;Limitations&quot;]&#10;    LM1[&quot;Single-variable operations only&quot;]&#10;    LM2[&quot;Degrades under high contention&quot;]&#10;&#10;    IMPL --&gt; HW&#10;    HW --&gt; HW1&#10;    HW --&gt; HW2&#10;    HW --&gt; HW3&#10;    HW --&gt; HW4&#10;    IMPL --&gt; PROTO&#10;    PROTO --&gt; P1&#10;    PROTO --&gt; P2&#10;    IMPL --&gt; SW&#10;    SW --&gt; S1&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2&#10;    S1 --&gt; S3&#10;    IMPL --&gt; LIMIT&#10;    LIMIT --&gt; LM1&#10;    LIMIT --&gt; LM2\">flowchart TD\n    IMPL[\"Atomic Operation Implementation\"]\n\n    HW[\"Hardware Support\"]\n    HW1[\"CAS Instruction\"]\n    HW2[\"XCHG Instruction\"]\n    HW3[\"XADD Instruction\"]\n    HW4[\"LOCK Prefix\"]\n\n    PROTO[\"Cache Coherence\"]\n    P1[\"MESI Protocol\"]\n    P2[\"Cache Line Locking\"]\n\n    SW[\"Software Wrapper\"]\n    S1[\"Atomic Variable Class\"]\n    S2[\"load / store\"]\n    S3[\"fetchAdd / CAS\"]\n\n    LIMIT[\"Limitations\"]\n    LM1[\"Single-variable operations only\"]\n    LM2[\"Degrades under high contention\"]\n\n    IMPL --&gt; HW\n    HW --&gt; HW1\n    HW --&gt; HW2\n    HW --&gt; HW3\n    HW --&gt; HW4\n    IMPL --&gt; PROTO\n    PROTO --&gt; P1\n    PROTO --&gt; P2\n    IMPL --&gt; SW\n    SW --&gt; S1\n    S1 --&gt; S2\n    S1 --&gt; S3\n    IMPL --&gt; LIMIT\n    LIMIT --&gt; LM1\n    LIMIT --&gt; LM2</pre><ul>\n<li>原子操作的不可分割性由<strong>CPU 硬件指令</strong>（CAS、XCHG、XADD 等）在底层保证</li>\n<li><strong>缓存一致性协议</strong>（如 MESI）确保多核处理器对共享数据的视图一致，是原子操作正确性的基础</li>\n<li>编程语言通过<strong>原子变量类</strong>封装底层指令，提供 <code>load</code>、<code>store</code>、<code>fetchAdd</code>、<code>compareAndSwap</code> 等高级 API</li>\n<li>原子操作可分为<strong>读写类、算术类、交换类、条件类、位操作类</strong>五大类别</li>\n<li>基于 CAS 可以构建更复杂的无锁操作（如 AtomicMax、AtomicFlag），但复杂度会显著增加</li>\n<li>原子操作的核心局限是<strong>只能保护单变量的单次操作</strong>，多变量或多步操作仍需使用锁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原子操作的实现机制","id":"原子操作的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心原理","id":"核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件支持：CPU 原子指令","id":"硬件支持-cpu-原子指令"},{"level":4,"text":"CAS 指令的硬件实现","id":"cas-指令的硬件实现"},{"level":4,"text":"XCHG 指令","id":"xchg-指令"},{"level":4,"text":"原子加减（XADD）","id":"原子加减-xadd"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存一致性协议","id":"缓存一致性协议"},{"level":2,"text":"分类与变体","id":"分类与变体"},{"level":3,"text":"软件封装：原子变量类","id":"软件封装-原子变量类"},{"level":3,"text":"常见原子操作分类","id":"常见原子操作分类"},{"level":3,"text":"用原子操作构建更高级的操作","id":"用原子操作构建更高级的操作"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"完整的原子操作执行路径","id":"完整的原子操作执行路径"},{"level":3,"text":"多线程竞争下的执行时序","id":"多线程竞争下的执行时序"},{"level":2,"text":"优劣对比","id":"优劣对比"},{"level":3,"text":"原子操作的适用边界","id":"原子操作的适用边界"},{"level":3,"text":"各种同步机制对比","id":"各种同步机制对比"},{"level":3,"text":"局限性","id":"局限性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原子操作的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-core-ideas"},"next":{"title":"锁的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/locks/lock-definition-and-concepts"}}